---
---

<section class="hero">
  <div class="hero-content">
    <p class="hero-sub">ホームページ制作・Webサイト構築</p>
    <h1>ビジネスの<br /><span class="highlight">次のステージ</span>へ</h1>
    <p class="hero-desc">
      店舗、フリーランス、中小企業、スタートアップ。<br />
      あなたのビジネスに合ったWebサイトを、<br />
      最短1週間でお届けします。
    </p>
    <div class="hero-actions">
      <a href="#contact" class="btn-primary">無料で相談する</a>
      <a href="#plan" class="btn-secondary">料金プランを見る</a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="hero-visual">
    <div class="mountain-icon">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 200 120" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
        <path d="M0 120 L70 25 L100 60 L140 10 L200 120Z" fill="var(--color-primary)" opacity="0.15"/>
        <path d="M20 120 L90 35 L120 65 L160 15 L200 120Z" fill="var(--color-primary)" opacity="0.25"/>
        <path d="M140 15 L150 30 L160 20 L170 35 L140 15Z" fill="var(--color-accent)" opacity="0.6"/>
      </svg>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .hero {
    min-height: 100vh;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 6rem 1.5rem 4rem;
    max-width: var(--max-width);
    margin: 0 auto;
    gap: 3rem;
  }

  .hero-content {
    flex: 1;
  }

  .hero-sub {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--color-primary);
    font-weight: 500;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  h1 {
    font-size: 2.8rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.4;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .highlight {
    color: var(--color-primary);
    position: relative;
  }

  .highlight::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 2px;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    height: 8px;
    background: var(--color-accent);
    opacity: 0.4;
    z-index: -1;
  }

  .hero-desc {
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: var(--color-text-light);
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    line-height: 2;
  }

  .hero-actions {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .btn-primary {
    background: var(--color-primary);
    color: #fff;
    padding: 0.85rem 2rem;
    border-radius: 8px;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 1rem;
    transition: background 0.2s, transform 0.2s;
  }

  .btn-primary:hover {
    background: var(--color-primary-dark);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  .btn-secondary {
    border: 2px solid var(--color-primary);
    color: var(--color-primary);
    padding: 0.85rem 2rem;
    border-radius: 8px;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 1rem;
    transition: all 0.2s;
  }

  .btn-secondary:hover {
    background: var(--color-primary);
    color: #fff;
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  .hero-visual {
    flex: 0.6;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .mountain-icon svg {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 300px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .hero {
      flex-direction: column;
      text-align: center;
      min-height: auto;
      padding-top: 8rem;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: 2rem;
    }

    .hero-actions {
      justify-content: center;
    }

    .hero-visual {
      order: -1;
    }

    .mountain-icon svg {
      max-width: 200px;
    }
  }
</style>
